    "original_text": "Gouranga Charan, Tawfik Osman, Andrew Hredzak, Ngwe Thawdar, and Ahmed Alkhateeb. Vision-position multimodal beam prediction using real millimeter wave datasets. In 2022 IEEE Wireless Communications and Networking Conference (WCNC), pages 2727–2731. IEEE, 2022.",
